#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:74
#: f8f101c521304d19bd1b68b4585f98d1
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:76
#: 1701ab0d15b54203b9b82f099dc83185
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1/2, 3/4, 5/6, 7/8/9 , and 10."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但在同一组内混用 DShot 和普通 PWM 受到限制，即在某组内为某输出启用 "
"DShot，则该组所有输出均须配置并使用 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须使用相同模式（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1/2、3/4、5/6、7/8/9 以及 10。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:78
#: 49566adc080748f68d75ece8e71c548c
msgid "PWM9 is a solder pad, and PWM10 is marked as \"LED\""
msgstr "PWM9 为焊盘，PWM10 标记为 「LED」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:81
#: 26af6f225d88488aacb5183a3f2d534e
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:83
#: 27030dd5b0fb482f8f4712df9227f54f
msgid ""
"The first 8 servo/motor outputs are marked on the board: M1,M2,S3-S8 . S9 is"
" a solder pad on the board, and S10 is connected to the pin marked LED in "
"ArduPilot's definition. Using S10 allows the easy grouping for odd numbers "
"of motors with a common DShot or PWM frequency without sacrificing the use "
"of an output for servo use due to rate issues (see above Dshot discussion)."
msgstr ""
"前 8 路舵机/电机输出在飞控上标记为 M1、M2、S3~S8。S9 为飞控上的焊盘，S10 在 ArduPilot 定义中连接到标记为 LED "
"的引脚。使用 S10 可以轻松将奇数个电机分组，共用 DShot 或 PWM 频率，而无需为避免频率问题牺牲舵机用途的输出（参见上方 DShot "
"讨论）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:87
#: 6fc886693ea24321958b65b840a62106
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:89
#: 82febf3b6cb2405e9116e363ca8b2700
msgid ""
"The SBUS pin, is passed by an inverter to R2 (UART2 RX), which by default is"
" mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all "
"ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚经反相器传递至 R2（UART2 RX），默认映射为定时器输入而非 UART，支持所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 "
"CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（这两种协议需要真正的 UART 连接）。但是，FPort 以此方式连接时仅能提供 RC 信号，不含数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:91
#: 2b39576eef844f35895fa89f4c52fa7d
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the R2 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART2 RX pin"
" for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL7 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"如需在 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中使用 CRSF 及内嵌数传，可将 R2 引脚配置为真正的 UART2 RX 引脚，将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设为 「1」，使其成为 SERIAL7 端口的 RX "
"输入引脚，从而支持双向系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:93
#: 82bdd099ac2d4231b95687340743c1fa
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` 必须设为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:95
#: e1bb52d106b247ac964e2f675e362350
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:97
#: e75d3f3959874e2fad93c6b420c1e9f0
msgid ""
"DSM/SRXL connects to the R2  pin, but SBUS would still be connected to SBUS."
msgstr "DSM/SRXL 连接到 R2 引脚，但 SBUS 仍连接到 SBUS 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:99
#: a7c939e1b7d14856a4794e7a2d8c6c3f
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T2 and R2 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需要通过双向反相器连接到 T2 和 R2。请参阅 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:101
#: feee23e19de84ee899d36a1683d74117
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除需连接 R2 外，还需要 T2 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:103
#: 73186438846b40df8a00a311f9716df8
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T2 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405-wing.rst:105
#: b464ce363aeb424b8d2ed636c27d5541
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM (SBUS requires external inversion "
"on other UARTs). See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任何 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议（SBUS 在其他 UART 上需要外部反相）。详情请参阅"
" :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

